      "block_id": "2605.18130_p11_b11",
      "text": "3) Ablation Study on Semantic Prompt Dependency and\nRobustness: As detailed in Table VIII, the integration of\ncorrect fine-grained text prompts yields the highest diagnostic\nperformance, confirming that semantic knowledge effectively\nacts as a spatial prior to guide precise lesion localization.\nMore importantly, when subjected to random or deliberately\nmismatched prompts, the framework exhibits remarkable sta-\nbility, maintaining an ACC above 93.22% without catastrophic\ndegradation.\n",
